        <div class="option-item"><strong>C)</strong> 1.5 ATP molecules from NADH and 2.5 molecules from FADH2.</div>
        <div class="option-item"><strong>D)</strong> 4.0 ATP molecules from NADH and 3.0 molecules from FADH2.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

